------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portions of this project are adapted from ProteinMPNN
(https://github.com/dauparas/ProteinMPNN, Dauparas et al., 2022). Derived
components appear in:

  foldmapper/model_utils.py
      ProteinFeatures, EncLayer, DecLayer, PositionWiseFeedForward,
      PositionalEncodings; gather_edges, gather_nodes, gather_nodes_t,
      cat_neighbors_nodes; featurize (extended with an evolutionary-profile
      tensor); loss_nll, loss_smoothed; NoamOpt, get_std_opt.

  foldmapper/utils.py
      StructureDataset, StructureLoader, worker_init_fn; build_training_clusters;
      get_pdbs, PDB_dataset (extended to consume PDB + TED shards and a cached
      per-residue evolutionary-profile tensor).

These components are used under the MIT License reproduced below.

